  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "adv.",
      "zh": "几乎，差不多"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Almost"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " everyone agreed that the New Year party was a great success."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "几乎所有人都认为，新年晚会办得很成功。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "almost 是常考单词，相当于 nearly 或 not quite，所以学生一定要掌握其固定搭配，及比较与 nearly 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "almost"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 可与 no, none, nobody, nothing, never 连用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "nearly"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 不可与 no, none, nobody, nothing, never 连用，只可与 not, pretty, very 连用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Almost no"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " one took any rest. 几乎没有一个人歇过一下。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The car is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "pretty nearly"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " new. 这辆汽车几乎是全新的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "另外，almost 常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：almost never 与 hardly ever 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "almost never"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " drinks Coke. = He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "hardly ever"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " drinks Coke."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他几乎从不喝可乐。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
